  "project_description": "Open the login form in a modal or off-canvas dialog with a key combination, optionally redirecting after login.\n\n Note: this functions when not-logged-in.\n\n Post-Installation \n The default configuration: Ctrl-Meta-L can be overridden at: Administration > Configuration > User interface > Login Dialog Hotkey.\n\n Logout or open your site in a new private or incognito browser window and invoke the key combination to show the login dialog.",
